    "body": "I removed the stray newlines. I also checked web-platform-tests for any tests expecting this exception. It only showed up in one file (html/canvas/element/manual/imagebitmap/createImageBitmap-origin.sub.html), but those tests are asserting that a SecurityError is thrown by getImageData() and toDataURL() after drawing a cross-origin bitmap to the canvas, not by createImageBitmap() itself. So removing this note shouldn't break any existing WPT tests",
